    "description": "This bright and spacious four-bedroom, two-bathroom home is available for rent in the desirable Mission Terrace neighborhood of San Francisco. Natural light fills the home throughout, and the primary bedroom features an extra-large closet for ample storage. Both bathrooms have been remodeled, including a deep soaking tub in one of the baths.\nThe kitchen is well equipped with a refrigerator, gas range, generous cabinet space, and Quartz countertops, making it a great space for cooking and entertaining. A sunroom at the back of the house adds bonus living space, and an in-unit washer and dryer make day-to-day living easy. One parking space is included in the driveway.\nIdeally situated close to public transportation and BART, this home is convenient to restaurants, banks, produce stores, a private K-8 school, and the neighborhood library.\nKey Features:\n- 4 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom\n- Mission Terrace neighborhood\n- Abundant natural lighting\n- Extra-large master bedroom closet\n- Recently remodeled bathrooms, including a deep soaking tub\n- Kitchen with refrigerator, gas range, ample cabinetry, and Quartz countertops\n- Sun room\n- Washer and dryer included (as-is condition)\n- One parking space in driveway\n- Convenient to public transportation, BART, restaurants, banks, produce stores, private K-8 school, and neighborhood library\n- Tenants are responsible for all utilities - Kenny Realty will bill monthly\n- No pets please",
